: 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "Rico. It is sited in a natural dip", "x": 42.83, "y": 73.04, "w": 15.79, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "making it difficult to see when", "x": 42.8, "y": 73.98, "w": 15.92, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "grounded although it is just a", "x": 42.77, "y": 74.92, "w": 15.5, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "few hundred yards from the", "x": 42.8, "y": 75.85, "w": 14.8, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "CariPPean Sea. When seen", "x": 42.77, "y": 76.79, "w": 14.8, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "aloft of course it is visible for", "x": 42.8, "y": 77.72, "w": 14.85, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "many miles.", "x": 42.8, "y": 78.66, "w": 6.54, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "I have visited Puerto Rico a", "x": 42.83, "y": 80.75, "w": 14.51, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "few times mainly because of", "x": 42.83, "y": 81.68, "w": 15.43, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "the UFO situation in that coun-", "x": 42.8, "y": 82.62, "w": 15.8, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "try. Many of the local people", "x": 42.74, "y": 83.55, "w": 15.55, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "question the government's", "x": 42.83, "y": 84.49, "w": 14.23, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "reason for the Aerostat (to", "x": 42.86, "y": 85.43, "w": 13.8, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "comPat illegal drug trafficking)", "x": 42.86, "y": 86.36, "w": 16.27, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "and wonder if its real purpose", "x": 42.83, "y": 87.3, "w": 15.82, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "is to monitor the coming and", "x": 42.89, "y": 88.23, "w": 15.53, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "going of the many UFOs", "x": 42.83, "y": 89.17, "w": 12.99, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "reported and seen there.", "x": 42.8, "y": 90.11, "w": 13.44, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "On one of my trips to the", "x": 42.83, "y": 92.02, "w": 13.44, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "island I decided to visit and", "x": 42.95, "y": 92.94, "w": 14.59, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "explore the equally infamous", "x": 42.86, "y": 93.85, "w": 15.43, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "This matter of wishing or pre-", "x": 60.4, "y": 7.0, "w": 14.8, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "coggoing crop circle designs", "x": 60.49, "y": 7.94, "w": 15.59, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "is nowhere properly examined;", "x": 60.46, "y": 8.87, "w": 16.3, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "he sights a drawing Py an", "x": 60.46, "y": 9.81, "w": 13.75, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "American woman which, he", "x": 60.37, "y": 10.75, "w": 15.16, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "says suPsequently turned up in", "x": 60.37, "y": 11.68, "w": 16.34, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "nature yet the circle cited has", "x": 60.43, "y": 12.62, "w": 16.01, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "almost no similarity to the", "x": 60.4, "y": 13.55, "w": 13.56, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "drawing I", "x": 60.43, "y": 14.49, "w": 4.82, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "I accept that one can easily", "x": 60.46, "y": 25.92, "w": 15.3, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "distinguish Petween genuine", "x": 60.43, "y": 26.87, "w": 15.19, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "and hoaxed circles, so why", "x": 60.43, "y": 27.83, "w": 14.59, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "does Colin's catalogue illus-", "x": 60.4, "y": 28.79, "w": 14.59, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "trate all the fakes without dis-", "x": 60.43, "y": 29.75, "w": 15.04, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "tinction, and why are their sites", "x": 60.37, "y": 30.7, "w": 16.37, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "not identified?", "x": 60.46, "y": 31.66, "w": 7.61, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "This comes over as sheer slop-", "x": 60.43, "y": 33.58, "w": 15.86, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "piness, and like so much of", "x": 60.46, "y": 34.51, "w": 14.47, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "the book it undermines Colin's", "x": 60.43, "y": 35.45, "w": 16.04, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "claims. In the end I am left", "x": 60.49, "y": 36.38, "w": 14.32, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "with two major questions; and,", "x": 60.43, "y": 37.32, "w": 16.18, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "until these are answered, the", "x": 60.49, "y": 38.26, "w": 15.34, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "whole Crop circle thing", "x": 60.43, "y": 39.19, "w": 12.45, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "remains a fuzzy puzzle. First,", "x": 60.46, "y": 40.13, "w": 14.59, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "Laguna Cartagena where", "x": 60.61, "y": 62.7, "w": 13.74, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "there have been many UFOs", "x": 60.49, "y": 63.64, "w": 15.43, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "reported entering and exiting", "x": 60.55, "y": 64.58, "w": 15.5, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "the water for many years. I", "x": 60.49, "y": 65.51, "w": 14.2, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "was told by a man and his", "x": 60.52, "y": 66.45, "w": 14.26, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "wife who live near the lake", "x": 60.49, "y": 67.38, "w": 14.16, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "that on one very early morn-", "x": 60.52, "y": 68.32, "w": 14.89, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "ing they saw three differently", "x": 60.55, "y": 69.26, "w": 15.17, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "shaped 'Ovni' flying aPove the", "x": 60.52, "y": 70.19, "w": 16.36, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "lake area shining Peams on", "x": 60.58, "y": 71.13, "w": 14.86, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "the ground.", "x": 60.49, "y": 72.06, "w": 6.39, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "why do some people deliPer-", "x": 78.15, "y": 6.94, "w": 15.56, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "ately fake crop circles? Are", "x": 78.12, "y": 7.87, "w": 14.44, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "they paid Py the government", "x": 78.12, "y": 8.81, "w": 15.7, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "(see Colin's revelation aPout", "x": 78.21, "y": 9.75, "w": 15.01, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "how the British Army 'set-up' a", "x": 78.18, "y": 10.68, "w": 15.65, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "Pogus circle right in the mid-", "x": 78.18, "y": 11.62, "w": 14.95, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "dle of his supposedly scientific", "x": 78.15, "y": 12.55, "w": 16.04, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "'Operation BlackPird'), or is the", "x": 78.18, "y": 13.49, "w": 16.15, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "CIA behind all the fakery? Or", "x": 78.15, "y": 14.43, "w": 15.21, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "are they serving a secret alien", "x": 78.15, "y": 15.36, "w": 16.07, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "base on earth?", "x": 78.18, "y": 16.3, "w": 8.24, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "My second question is: what", "x": 78.21, "y": 18.28, "w": 15.07, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "do all these increasingly com-", "x": 78.15, "y": 19.21, "w": 15.74, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "plex signs mean? Going from", "x": 78.18, "y": 20.15, "w": 15.67, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "plain circles to the Julia set", "x": 78.24, "y": 21.09, "w": 14.35, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "and other complex mathe-", "x": 78.18, "y": 22.02, "w": 14.32, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "matical and astronomical", "x": 78.21, "y": 22.96, "w": 13.87, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "designs, what are the (pre-", "x": 78.18, "y": 23.89, "w": 13.93, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "sumaPly alien) creators trying", "x": 78.18, "y": 24.83, "w": 15.59, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "to tell us?", "x": 78.15, "y": 25.77, "w": 5.14, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "Isn't it odd that, if these really", "x": 78.21, "y": 27.81, "w": 15.32, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "are alien creations they should", "x": 78.15, "y": 28.75, "w": 16.34, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "be utterly incomprehensiPle?", "x": 78.21, "y": 29.68, "w": 15.35, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "And why hasn't Colin Andrews", "x": 78.12, "y": 30.62, "w": 15.89, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "or his many supporters tried to", "x": 78.18, "y": 31.55, "w": 16.0, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "figure out just what if anything", "x": 78.18, "y": 32.49, "w": 15.83, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "they mean?", "x": 78.18, "y": 33.43, "w": 6.55, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "As I said: I'm disappointed.", "x": 78.18, "y": 35.43, "w": 14.31, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "Can anyone provide some", "x": 78.21, "y": 36.36, "w": 14.47, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "properly supported answers?", "x": 78.21, "y": 37.3, "w": 15.17, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "Without a single clue, the", "x": 78.18, "y": 38.23, "w": 13.47, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "whole topic seems pointless.", "x": 78.15, "y": 39.17, "w": 15.22, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "Ken Lake, Loughton, Essex", "x": 80.26, "y": 40.71, "w": 14.32, "h": 0.95, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "I hired a Picycle and set off", "x": 78.24, "y": 42.83, "w": 14.78, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "from my Pase in Parguera tak-", "x": 78.24, "y": 43.77, "w": 15.8, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "ing the short route through the", "x": 78.24, "y": 44.7, "w": 16.03, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "hills. After 30 minutes or so I", "x": 78.21, "y": 45.64, "w": 14.59, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "realised I was lost. It was early", "x": 78.24, "y": 46.58, "w": 15.65, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "morning so on passing a", "x": 78.27, "y": 47.51, "w": 13.18, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "house I stopped and asked for", "x": 78.24, "y": 48.45, "w": 16.32, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "directions.", "x": 78.21, "y": 49.38, "w": 5.42, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "It so happened the person I", "x": 78.27, "y": 51.36, "w": 14.83, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "asked actually waked for the", "x": 78.21, "y": 52.3, "w": 15.58, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "police department. After initial", "x": 78.33, "y": 53.23, "w": 15.92, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "pleasantries were exchanged,", "x": 78.18, "y": 54.17, "w": 16.12, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "in broken Spanish-English, I", "x": 78.27, "y": 55.11, "w": 14.08, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "was told that this person had", "x": 78.21, "y": 56.04, "w": 15.38, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "a close relative who worked", "x": 78.24, "y": 56.98, "w": 14.85, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "for NASA at the Aerostat instal-", "x": 78.24, "y": 57.92, "w": 15.68, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "lation, and that they have 'lit-", "x": 78.24, "y": 58.85, "w": 15.22, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "tle creatures' down therel", "x": 78.24, "y": 59.79, "w": 13.54, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "When I asked for more infor-", "x": 78.21, "y": 60.72, "w": 14.71, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "mation they told me it was", "x": 78.27, "y": 61.66, "w": 14.23, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "dangerous to say more. (I am", "x": 78.24, "y": 62.6, "w": 16.25, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "being purposefully vague in", "x": 78.27, "y": 63.53, "w": 14.8, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "their description.)", "x": 78.18, "y": 64.47, "w": 9.22, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "The puzzle is why would NASA", "x": 78.15, "y": 66.62, "w": 15.66, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "operate a Drug Trafficking", "x": 78.27, "y": 67.55, "w": 13.78, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "oPservation Palloon? Many", "x": 78.27, "y": 68.49, "w": 14.44, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "Puerto Ricans are also puzzled", "x": 78.27, "y": 69.43, "w": 16.19, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "Py the situation.", "x": 78.27, "y": 70.36, "w": 8.47, "h": 0.89, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "M Prentis", "x": 89.63, "y": 71.26, "w": 5.05, "h": 0.95, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "Nottingham", "x": 88.0, "y": 72.2, "w": 6.58, "h": 0.95, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "LEEDS", "x": 62.21, "y": 75.42, "w": 6.69, "h": 2.27, "fontSize": 17.0}, {"text": "CONFERENCE REFUNDS", "x": 68.9, "y": 75.42, "w": 25.57, "h": 2.27, "fontSize": 16.9}, {"text": "Refunds are being paid back in order of", "x": 64.04, "y": 79.03, "w": 27.53, "h": 1.22, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "receipt and although taking longer than first", "x": 62.81, "y": 80.43, "w": 30.01, "h": 1.22, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "anticipated it is a continuing process.", "x": 65.01, "y": 81.82, "w": 25.64, "h": 1.22, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "We thank you for your patience and under-", "x": 62.84, "y": 83.2, "w": 29.52, "h": 1.22, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "standing over the last few difficult weeks and", "x": 62.3, "y": 84.58, "w": 31.07, "h": 1.22, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "assure you that all refunds will be made.", "x": 63.77, "y": 85.96, "w": 28.11, "h": 1.22, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "Christine Birdsall is dealing with the refunds", "x": 62.72, "y": 88.75, "w": 30.27, "h": 1.22, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "personally and can be contacted at this email", "x": 62.12, "y": 90.11, "w": 31.49, "h": 1.22, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "address", "x": 66.4, "y": 91.48, "w": 5.42, "h": 1.22, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "orders@ufomag.co.uk", "x": 71.82, "y": 91.48, "w": 17.44, "h": 1.22, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "78", "x": 7.44, "y": 96.64, "w": 2.12, "h": 1.57, "fontSize": 10.9}]}